        "title": "[2606.24628] ArtiTwinSplat: Interactable Digital Twin Reconstruction via Gaussian Splatting from RGB-D videos",
        "description": "Abstract page for arXiv paper 2606.24628: ArtiTwinSplat: Interactable Digital Twin Reconstruction via Gaussian Splatting from RGB-D videos",
